@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "New Possibilities";
}

<main class="gw-possibilities">

    <!-- =====================================================
         HERO
         ===================================================== -->
    <section class="gw-possibilities-hero">
        <div class="gw-hero-overlay"></div>

        <div class="container">
            <div class="gw-hero-content">

                <p class="gw-eyebrow">
                    Come spend part of the day with us
                </p>

                <h1>
                    <span aria-hidden="true">✨</span>
                    New Possibilities
                </h1>

                <p class="gw-lead">
                    Every sunrise brings another chance to discover
                    what may still be possible.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Sometimes life is not asking us to start over.
                    Sometimes it is simply inviting us to take one thoughtful
                    step toward something new.
                </p>

                <a class="gw-button gw-button-primary"
                   href="#possibilities-begin">
                    See What’s Possible
                </a>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         A QUIET QUESTION
         ===================================================== -->
    <section id="possibilities-begin"
             class="gw-journey-section gw-journey-section--warm">

        <div class="container gw-reading-width">

            <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                A quiet question
            </p>

            <h2>
                Could there be something more?
            </h2>

            <p>
                Not because your life is bad.
            </p>

            <p>
                Not because you need to become someone else.
            </p>

            <p>
                But because something inside you may still be curious
                about what the next chapter could hold.
            </p>

            <p class="gw-emphasis">
                Maybe...
                <br />
                you do have new possibilities.
            </p>

        </div>
    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         POSSIBILITY LOOKS DIFFERENT
         ===================================================== -->
    <section class="gw-journey-section">

        <div class="container gw-reading-width">

            <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                Possibility looks different for everyone
            </p>

            <h2>
                There is no single definition of a meaningful next step.
            </h2>

            <p>
                For one person, it may mean creating a little more
                financial breathing room.
            </p>

            <p>
                For another, it may mean meeting new people, learning
                new skills, rebuilding confidence, or discovering a
                renewed sense of purpose.
            </p>

            <p>
                Sometimes it is not about changing everything.
            </p>

            <p>
                Sometimes it is simply about having more choices.
            </p>

            <blockquote class="gw-journey-quote">
                The best possibilities rarely arrive looking like possibilities.
                They often arrive looking like conversations.
            </blockquote>

        </div>
    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         WHAT COULD IT MEAN?
         ===================================================== -->
    <section class="gw-journey-section gw-journey-section--soft">

        <div class="container">

            <div class="gw-section-heading">

                <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                    Your definition matters
                </p>

                <h2>
                    What would make life feel a little easier?
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Success does not have to mean becoming wealthy.
                    It may simply mean creating enough room to breathe,
                    enjoy life, and make choices with greater confidence.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="gw-possibility-grid">

                <article class="gw-possibility-card">

                    <span class="gw-possibility-card__icon"
                          aria-hidden="true">
                        🌐
                    </span>

                    <h3>
                        Covering a monthly expense
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Perhaps it begins by paying for your internet,
                        utilities, or another recurring bill.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="gw-possibility-card">

                    <span class="gw-possibility-card__icon"
                          aria-hidden="true">
                        ✈️
                    </span>

                    <h3>
                        Enjoying more experiences
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Maybe it means taking a trip you have postponed
                        or enjoying life with a little less worry.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="gw-possibility-card">

                    <span class="gw-possibility-card__icon"
                          aria-hidden="true">
                        🤝
                    </span>

                    <h3>
                        Helping someone you love
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        It may mean helping your children, grandchildren,
                        family, or someone who simply needs a hand.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="gw-possibility-card">

                    <span class="gw-possibility-card__icon"
                          aria-hidden="true">
                        🌅
                    </span>

                    <h3>
                        Having choices again
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Sometimes breathing room means being able to choose
                        without fear making the decision for you.
                    </p>

                </article>

            </div>

            <p class="gw-section-closing">
                No one else gets to define success for you.
            </p>

        </div>
    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         SOMETHING FAMILIAR
         ===================================================== -->
    <section class="gw-journey-section">

        <div class="container gw-reading-width">

            <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                Something familiar
            </p>

            <h2>
                You may already understand how this begins.
            </h2>

            <p>
                When you discover a great restaurant, you tell a friend.
            </p>

            <p>
                When a mechanic treats you fairly, you recommend them.
            </p>

            <p>
                When something genuinely improves your life, sharing
                your experience often feels natural.
            </p>

            <p class="gw-emphasis">
                That is not pressure.
                That is one person helping another.
            </p>

        </div>
    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         AUTHENTICITY
         ===================================================== -->
    <section class="gw-journey-section gw-journey-section--deep">

        <div class="container gw-reading-width">

            <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                Authenticity matters
            </p>

            <h2>
                You do not have to become someone else.
            </h2>

            <div class="gw-simple-list"
                 role="list">

                <div class="gw-simple-list__item"
                     role="listitem">

                    <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>

                    <p>
                        You do not need to become a salesperson.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="gw-simple-list__item"
                     role="listitem">

                    <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>

                    <p>
                        You do not need a perfect presentation.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="gw-simple-list__item"
                     role="listitem">

                    <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>

                    <p>
                        You do not need to pressure or convince anyone.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="gw-simple-list__item"
                     role="listitem">

                    <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>

                    <p>
                        You are allowed to listen, learn, and grow
                        at your own pace.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

            <blockquote class="gw-journey-quote gw-journey-quote--light">
                People trust people—not presentations.
            </blockquote>

            <p>
                Lasting relationships begin with honesty, curiosity,
                kindness, and a willingness to care about the person
                in front of you.
            </p>

        </div>
    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         ONE SMALL STEP
         ===================================================== -->
    <section class="gw-journey-section">

        <div class="container gw-reading-width">

            <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                One small step
            </p>

            <h2>
                Growth usually begins quietly.
            </h2>

            <p>
                The biggest changes in life rarely begin with a perfect plan.
            </p>

            <p>
                They begin with one question.
            </p>

            <p>
                One conversation.
            </p>

            <p>
                One decision to see where a new road might lead.
            </p>

            <p class="gw-emphasis">
                You do not have to know everything.
                You only have to be willing to explore.
            </p>

        </div>
    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         REFLECTION
         ===================================================== -->
    <section class="gw-journey-reflection">

        <div class="container gw-reading-width">

            <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                Take a moment
            </p>

            <h2>
                What if the real possibility is discovering
                something about yourself?
            </h2>

            <p>
                Maybe you arrived here out of curiosity.
            </p>

            <p>
                Maybe you were simply looking for something different.
            </p>

            <p>
                Maybe you were not even sure why you clicked.
            </p>

            <p class="gw-emphasis">
                Whatever brought you here...
                we are glad you came.
            </p>

            <div class="gw-reflection-words"
                 aria-label="Hope, possibility, confidence, direction and purpose">

                <span>Hope</span>
                <span>Possibility</span>
                <span>Confidence</span>
                <span>Direction</span>
                <span>Purpose</span>

            </div>

            <p>
                Perhaps today is not about making a decision.
            </p>

            <p>
                Perhaps it is simply about remembering that you are
                still curious, still growing, and still capable of
                writing another chapter.
            </p>

            <blockquote class="gw-journey-quote">
                Sometimes the greatest possibility is discovering
                what we are still capable of becoming.
            </blockquote>

        </div>
    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         THANK YOU
         ===================================================== -->
    <section class="gw-journey-thank-you">

        <div class="container gw-reading-width">

            <span class="gw-thank-you__icon"
                  aria-hidden="true">
                🌅
            </span>

            <h2>
                Thank you for spending part of your day with us.
            </h2>

            <p>
                Life moves quickly.
            </p>

            <p>
                The fact that you chose to spend a few moments here
                means more than you know.
            </p>

            <p>
                Whether this becomes the beginning of a new friendship,
                a healthier lifestyle, a new direction, or simply a
                reminder that tomorrow is another sunrise...
            </p>

            <p>
                Thank you.
            </p>

            <p class="gw-emphasis">
                Wherever your next chapter leads,
                we hope it is a wonderful one.
            </p>

        </div>
    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         CONTINUE THE JOURNEY
         ===================================================== -->
    <section class="gw-journey-conversation">

        <div class="container gw-reading-width">

            <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                Whenever you are ready
            </p>

            <h2>
                Your journey does not have to end here.
            </h2>

            <p>
                No pressure.
                No expectations.
                No rehearsed sales pitch.
            </p>

            <p>
                Just another step forward and a chance to reflect
                on what your next chapter might look like.
            </p>

            <div class="gw-button-row">

                <a class="gw-button gw-button-primary"
                   asp-controller="Home"
                   asp-action="NextChapter">
                    Your Next Chapter
                </a>

                <a class="gw-button gw-button-secondary"
                   asp-controller="Home"
                   asp-action="Index">
                    Return Home
                </a>

            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

</main>